{
  "title": "Lofty Wood-Fired Australian Tamarind Bake",
  "description": "Earthy, fluffy, show-off Australian dish featuring tamarind pulp, wood-fired-bake, ovo-vegetarian-friendly, served in a bamboo tray.",
