      "amount": "2 tbsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the wood-fired oven to 220°C.",
    "Roll out the whole wheat pastry dough and cut into 4 equal pieces.",
    "Mix together the tamarind pulp, sour cream, eggs, garlic, thyme, salt, and pepper in a bowl.",
    "Place one piece of pastry dough in the bamboo tray, topping with a quarter of the tamarind mixture and a sprinkle of walnuts.",
    "Repeat the layers 3 more times, finishing with a layer of pastry dough on top.",
    "Drizzle the honey over the top of the pastry.",
    "Place the bamboo tray in the wood-fired oven and bake for 25 minutes.",
    "Remove the tray from the oven and let it rest for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
